With reference to the Regulation 30 & 33 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 and the above mentioned subject, we wish to inform you that the Board of Directors in its Meeting held on Friday, 13th November, 2026 has approved the Un-Audited Financial Results of the Company for the quarter and half year ended 30th September, 2026. In this regard, please find enclosed herewith the following:
1. Un-Audited Financial Results along with the Statement of Un-Audited Assets and Liabilities & Cash Flow Statement for the quarter and half year ended on 30th September, 2026.

2. To take on record the Limited Review Report along with modified/unmodified opinion on the Financial Results for the quarter and half year ended on 30th September, 2026;
